<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "環境音\宴会.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "500" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\背景\居酒屋倉庫.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"These clothes already stink of cigarettes. Maybe I'll quit this job..."
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯着信1.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<PG>
"From the police...?"<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
"Yes, this is Goto. 
{PAUSE ""}
Yes, Momoko Goto. 
{PAUSE ""}
Yes... yes... 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Erina</STYLE>...!?
{PAUSE ""}
　Yes... yes... 
{PAUSE ""}
Understood! I'll be right there!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\sliding_wooden_door_C.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "900" "300" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Hey, </STYLE>Momo-chan<STYLE ID="2">, your break's already over."</STYLE><PG>
"Manager, I'm sorry! Please let me leave early!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Huh!? Don't be stupid, we've got lots of customers right now. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\sliding_wooden_door_C.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "500" "300" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">More importantly, there's something I want to talk to you about..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"What is it...?"<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE>Momo-chan<STYLE ID="2">, do you have a boyfriend or anything?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Excuse me?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"No, no, was that rude of me, so suddenly?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　I was thinking, if you'd like, how about dinner or something on our next day off?"</STYLE><PG>
"Sorry, I have another part-time job that day..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Oh, I see... Is there any other day you're free?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I'm basically working almost every day... I don't have a day off all April."<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Really? That's rough. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">When do you hang out with your boyfriend?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"It doesn't... matter, does it, that kind of thing..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"No, see, </STYLE>Momo-chan<STYLE ID="2">, customers hassle you a lot, right?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　I thought it'd be good if I taught you how to deal with that kind of situation and so on."</STYLE><PG>
"What does that have to do with a boyfriend?
{PAUSE ""}
　Like I said before, it's an emergency, so I'm leaving early."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"What, you're ignoring my invitation?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"My <STYLE ID="1">sister</STYLE> has apparently been taken into protective custody by the police!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"The police...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Ha ha, if she's the sister of someone like </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="3">, then</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> she must've done something bad, right?"</STYLE><PG>
"Huh!? Why would <STYLE ID="1">Erina</STYLE> do anything like that!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Your sister</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> won't run away from the police, so clock in on time like you're supposed to."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I'm going home."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I'm telling you, don't go home! If you go home, you're fired!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　There aren't many places a delinquent girl like </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="2"> can work, you know!?"</STYLE><PG>
"............"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Well, someone like </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="2"> quitting 3 days after starting is about what I expected. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Do you know the cafe called Primavera? I'm a fan of their poster girl."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Ha ha, not that </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="2">'d reach that level even in 100 years!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Go on, you pair of dropout sisters, get taken care of by the police like the dropouts you are."</STYLE><PG>
"Why, you...!"
{PLAYSND "SE\tackle1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{QUAKE "000,メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "1000" "30"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Ugh...! What are you doing...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I'm the one who wants nothing to do with working in a place like this!"
{PLAYSND "SE\tackle1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{QUAKE "000,メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "1000" "30"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Gwoh... that's a foul..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"That one was for my <STYLE ID="1">sister</STYLE>. 
{PAUSE ""}
Badmouthing me is one thing, but why drag <STYLE ID="1">Erina</STYLE> into it too!"
{PLAYSND "SE\tackle1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{QUAKE "000,メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "1000" "30"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Owww...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　I-I'll call the police...!"</STYLE><PG>
"Go right ahead. 
{PAUSE ""}
From now on, you are strictly refused entry to Primavera!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Wh-what...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"It has been a long while, <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="みちはた">Michihata</STYLE>-sama. Thank you ever so much for visiting us again today. 
{PAUSE ""}
Will your order be the usual, an iced cafe au lait with extra milk?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"That voice...!"</STYLE><PG>
"The poster girl of Primavera... 
{PAUSE ""}
Momoko Goto, 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">that's me!"</STYLE>
{PLAYSND "SE\tackle1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{QUAKE "000,メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "1000" "30"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\down1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Gwaaah..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Calling yourself a fan, and you can't even tell when I just change my expression and voice... 
{PAUSE ""}
Just be grateful that I even worked 3 days in a crummy shop like this for you!
{PAUSE ""}
　If you ever badmouth <STYLE ID="1">Erina</STYLE> again... 
{PAUSE ""}
I'll seriously kill you."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\アスファルト歩く.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\sliding_wooden_door_C.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "900" "300" "PASS"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Guh."</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
